ition:mwdefinition_5108d1569945a1e49dcb:r7:2b441af20540240c","span_id":"ev_sd_arms"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_5108d1569945a1e49dcb:revision:7","quote":"安慰剂：安慰剂组（匹配双模拟安慰剂），按1:1:1随机，分层因素为中心与基线咳嗽频率（<25 vs ≥25次/小时）","quote_sha256":"7e85799acfe3335b2a0b8e733938e9b7c7e910db3919b9c3cc33156bb5168928","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_5108d1569945a1e49dcb:r7:2b441af20540240c","span_id":"ev_sd_placebo"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_5108d1569945a1e49dcb:revision:7","quote":"剂量与给药方案：R5A-PX501片，口服P2X3受体拮抗剂（小分子，每日一次给药，规格20mg/40mg薄膜衣片，与安慰剂双模拟）：20mg QD；40mg QD（第1周由20mg起始滴定）","quote_sha256":"33c9d68bccad9418609249cacb41b3a5be61ab35219c2717e2b5dedcbbf2f8db","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_5108d1569945a1e49dcb:r7:2b441af20540240c","span_id":"ev_sd_dosage"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_5108d1569945a1e49dcb:revision:7","quote":"试验干预：R5A-PX501 20mg或40mg口服每日一次，连续8周（第1周为滴定导入：40mg组由20mg起始），匹配双模拟安慰剂","quote_sha256":"107efbd50784024c8d437747cd473ba1890b1c5793a76beebf97c95cf233d819","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_5108d1569945a1e49dcb:r7:2b441af20540240c","span_id":"ev_sd_intervention"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_5108d1569945a1e49dcb:revision:7","quote":"自适应设计是否计划：否\n样本量再估计是否计划：否\n期中分析是否计划：否\nSRC是否计划：否\nDMC是否计划：否","quote_sha256":"d192609ccba318766cd82ff78063ce30f2b165b2a2fe910e39eed2bf9435a059","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_5108d1569945a1e49dcb:r7:2b441af20540240c","span_id":"ev_sd_adaptive"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["ev_sec41","ev_sd_design","ev_sd_purpose","ev_sd_arms","ev_sd_placebo","ev_sd_dosage","ev_sd_intervention","ev_sd_adaptive"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":7},"gap_items":[{"action":"获取本项目盲法实施与紧急揭盲相关项目文件后补充；其他项目的揭盲流程不得直接沿用。","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_sec4_1_blinding_impl","missing_source_classes":["盲法实施与紧急揭盲程序相关项目文件"],"target":"4.1 总体设计（双盲实施与揭盲程序）"}],"heading":"总体设计","missing_source_classes":["盲法实施与紧急揭盲程序相关项目文件"],"proposal_text":"本研究采用多中心、随机、双盲、安慰剂对照、三臂平行组设计，研究目的为剂量探索与概念验证（PoC），对R5A-PX501 20mg与40mg两个口服剂量组和安慰剂进行比较。受试者按1:1:1随机分配至安慰剂组、R5A-PX501 20mg组或R5A-PX501 40mg组，随机分层因素为中心与基线咳嗽频率（<25次/小时 vs ≥25次/小时）。三个治疗组均每日一次口服给药，连续治疗8周，其中40mg组第1周由20mg起始滴定导入；安慰剂组接受匹配双模拟安慰剂。本研究不计划自适应设计、样本量再估计或期中分析，亦不设置SRC和DMC。","rationale":"正文依据已确认的总体设计要素撰写：多中心、随机、双盲、安慰剂对照、三臂平行组，1:1:1随机，按中心与基线咳嗽频率（<25 vs ≥25次/小时）分层，20mg与40mg每日一次口服8周（40mg组第1周由20mg起始滴定），不计划自适应设计、样本量再估计与期中分析，不设置SRC与DMC；双盲实施与揭盲程序须另行核实。","review_advisories":["本节复述高影响研究设计（总体设计）；请在合并设计摘要中统一核对。","本节提及高影响设计信息（期中分析、样本量）；系统未把重复提及升级为强制确认。","本节重复了多项总体设计事实；建议压缩为与本节直接相关的信息。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_90faa124c2ad_d4991e5d841b7ec9","section_number":"4.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:ba78fbfaefcf76e5eecfa9da","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_5108d1569945a1e49dcb:r7:2b441af20540240c","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:dbed66cc1d7b3a","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:4a27cdd782c3be","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:046677b43d417b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:97a2bd7fcf7302","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:8b49478f82c322"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261006060448_d131eb67","content_status":"partial","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_90faa124c2ad_246db92c9af41aa3:full-draft:ba78fbfaefcf76e5eecfa9da","quote":"SECTION_ID=mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_90faa124c2ad_4c9f57ac3ee077cf\n章节编号=4.2.1\n章节标题=剂量选择依据\n章节类型=section\n当前正文=（当前为空，需生成实质正文）","quote_sha256":"269fd3e4ceaba2c3e2a4ff6f35b5285b367c2f8acf5093ed84003b244396fded","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:ba78fbfaefcf76e5eecfa9da","span_id":"ev_sec421"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_5108d1569945a1e49dcb:revision:7","quote":"试验药物：R5A-PX501片，口服P2X3受体拮抗剂（小分子，每日一次给药，规格20mg/40mg薄膜衣片，与安慰剂双模拟）","quote_sha25